{"sha": "5c15c2418080e7b24ab633442cb3551ccb9ae5da807a0d481fe4eed4e137766b", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[概率守恒]\\label{prop:b2:schrodinger-wave-functions:current}", "概率密度 $\\rho = |\\psi|^2$ 与\\emph{概率", "流}\\index{概率流}", "\\[", "j = \\frac{\\hbar}{m}\\operatorname{Im}\\Big(\\psi^*\\frac{\\partial\\psi}{\\partial x}\\Big)", "= \\frac{\\hbar}{2\\iu m}\\Big(\\psi^*\\partial_x\\psi - \\psi\\,\\partial_x\\psi^*\\Big)", "\\]", "满足 $\\partial_t\\rho + \\partial_xj = 0$：概率既不产生，", "也不消失，且 $\\int|\\psi|^2\\dd x$ 始终等于 $1$。对平面波", "$A\\eu^{\\iu kx}$，$j = |A|^2\\hbar k/m = \\rho v$：即密度乘以速度，与", "任何流动一样。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\partial_t(\\psi^*\\psi) = \\psi^*\\partial_t\\psi + \\psi\\,\\partial_t\\psi^*$；由", "方程及其共轭，$\\partial_t\\psi = (\\iu\\hbar/2m)\\partial_x^2\\psi -", "(\\iu/\\hbar)V\\psi$，$\\partial_t\\psi^* = -(\\iu\\hbar/2m)\\partial_x^2\\psi^* +", "(\\iu/\\hbar)V\\psi^*$；$V$ 项相消，其余为 $(\\iu\\hbar/2m)(\\psi^*", "\\partial_x^2\\psi - \\psi\\,\\partial_x^2\\psi^*) = -\\partial_xj$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[动量、期望值与经典极限]\\label{prop:b2:schrodinger-wave-functions:ehrenfest}", "态的动量由算符 $\\hat p =", "-\\iu\\hbar\\,\\partial_x$（对平面波给出 $\\hbar k$）：$\\langle", "p\\rangle = \\int\\psi^*(-\\iu\\hbar\\partial_x\\psi)\\dd x$，能量则由 $\\hat H", "= -(\\hbar^2/2m)\\partial_x^2 + V$，期望值满足", "（埃伦费斯特）", "\\[", "\\frac{\\dd\\langle x\\rangle}{\\dd t} = \\frac{\\langle p\\rangle}{m}, \\qquad", "\\frac{\\dd\\langle p\\rangle}{\\dd t} = -\\Big\\langle\\frac{\\dd V}{\\dd x}\\Big\\rangle :", "\\]", "波包中心在 $V$ 至多为二次式时严格遵循牛顿定律，", "而只要波包的宽度相对于 $V$ 变化的尺度足够窄，便近似成立", "——即经典极限，", "对任何宏观物体都成立，因为 $\\hbar$ 极小。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $\\langle x\\rangle = \\int x|\\psi|^2$ 求导，利用 $\\partial_t\\rho =", "-\\partial_xj$，分部积分得 $\\dd\\langle x\\rangle/\\dd t = \\int j\\,\\dd x", "= \\langle p\\rangle/m$。第二式是同样的计算，", "只是高一阶（在本阶段不加证明地承认）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{定态}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[定态]\\label{thm:b2:schrodinger-wave-functions:stationary}", "若 $V$ 不依赖于时间，则方程具有", "分离变量形式的解：", "\\[", "\\psi(x,t) = \\varphi(x)\\,\\eu^{-\\iu Et/\\hbar}, \\qquad", "-\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m}\\,\\varphi'' + V\\varphi = E\\varphi", "\\]", "（\\emph{定态薛定谔方程}\\index{薛定谔", "方程!定态}）：\\emph{定态}\\index{定态", "定态}，具有确定能量 $E$，其概率密度", "$|\\varphi|^2$ 不随时间移动。能量 $E$ 若使 $\\varphi$", "可接受（有界，对束缚态须可归一化），", "则为\\emph{能级}；一般解为叠加 $\\psi =", "\\sum_nc_n\\varphi_n(x)\\eu^{-\\iu E_nt/\\hbar}$，两能级的叠加", "其密度以\\emph{玻尔频率}\\index{玻尔", "频率}振荡，$\\nu_{21} = (E_2 - E_1)/h$，即原子所发射", "或吸收的光的频率。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "代入 $\\varphi(x)f(t)$：$\\iu\\hbar f'/f = (-\\hbar^2\\varphi''/2m + V\\varphi)/\\varphi$，", "关于 $t$ 的函数等于关于 $x$ 的函数，故为常数 $E$；$f", "= \\eu^{-\\iu Et/\\hbar}$。对两个能级，$|c_1\\varphi_1\\eu^{-\\iu E_1t/\\hbar} +", "c_2\\varphi_2\\eu^{-\\iu E_2t/\\hbar}|^2 = |c_1\\varphi_1|^2 + |c_2\\varphi_2|^2 +", "2\\operatorname{Re}(c_1^*c_2\\varphi_1^*\\varphi_2\\eu^{-\\iu(E_2 - E_1)t/\\hbar})$。", "定态的完备性在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=7.4cm, height=4.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=1, ymin=-1.3, ymax=1.5,", "    xlabel={$x/L$}, ylabel={$\\psi$}, xtick={0.5,1}, ytick=\\empty, clip=false,", "    legend style={font=\\scriptsize, at={(0.5,-0.28)}, anchor=north, draw=none, fill=none, legend columns=3}]", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:1, samples=80] {1.41*sin(deg(pi*x))*cos(40)};", "    \\addlegendentry{$\\operatorname{Re}\\psi$}", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, dashed, domain=0:1, samples=80] {-1.41*sin(deg(pi*x))*sin(40)};", "    \\addlegendentry{$\\operatorname{Im}\\psi$}", "    \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:1, samples=80] {2*sin(deg(pi*x))^2-1.3};", "    \\addlegendentry{$|\\psi|^2$（平移后）}", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=9.4cm, yshift=1.3cm, >=stealth]", "    \\draw[->] (-1.5,0) -- (1.5,0) node[right, font=\\scriptsize] {实};", "    \\draw[->] (0,-1.5) -- (0,1.5) node[above, font=\\scriptsize] {虚};", "    \\draw[gray] (0,0) circle (1.1);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, very thick] (0,0) -- (-40:1.1);", "    \\draw[->, omDef] (1.1,0) arc (0:-40:1.1);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (-50:1.55) {$-Et/\\hbar$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (0,-1.85) {$\\eu^{-\\iu Et/\\hbar}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 定态：空间分布 $\\varphi(x)$（此处为势阱的", "基态）乘以一个以 $E/\\hbar$ 为速率旋转的相量；", "实部与虚部相互转化，而", "$|\\psi|^2$ 保持不动。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=9cm, height=4.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=1, ymin=0, ymax=2.6,", "    xlabel={$x/L$}, ylabel={$|\\psi|^2$}, xtick={0.5,1}, ytick=\\empty, clip=false,", "    legend style={font=\\scriptsize, at={(0.5,-0.28)}, anchor=north, draw=none, fill=none, legend columns=3}]", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:1, samples=100] {(sin(deg(pi*x)))^2 + (sin(deg(2*pi*x)))^2 + 2*sin(deg(pi*x))*sin(deg(2*pi*x))};", "    \\addlegendentry{$t = 0$}", "    \\addplot[omThm, thick, dashed, domain=0:1, samples=100] {(sin(deg(pi*x)))^2 + (sin(deg(2*pi*x)))^2};", "    \\addlegendentry{$t = T_{21}/4$}", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=0:1, samples=100] {(sin(deg(pi*x)))^2 + (sin(deg(2*pi*x)))^2 - 2*sin(deg(pi*x))*sin(deg(2*pi*x))};", "    \\addlegendentry{$t = T_{21}/2$}", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}